  "title": "NexPoint Bolsters Energy Platform with Addition of Geology Leader",
  "summary": "Chris Savage Joins NexEnergy to Lead Subsurface Evaluation and Asset Development DALLAS, August 7, 2026 – NexPoint, a multibillion-dollar alternative investment firm, today announced that Chris Savage has joined the firm’s recently launched energy platform, NexEnergy, as Vice President of Geology. In this role, Mr. Savage will lead subsurface evaluation and resource development efforts, supporting […]",
